r cream, milk, onion salt and pepper. Transfer to a greased large casserole dish.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Cover and bake for 50 minutes in</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">the preheated oven.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Option: This dish can be made ahead of time (refrigerate if it is made early in the day. Remove from refrigerator for about 30 minutes and then bake as directed above.</li> </ol> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"endeasyrecipe\" title=\"style002\" style=\"display: none\">3.5.3226</div> </div><br />\n </p>\n"
